{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-03954-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["통합 신당의 당명을 ‘민주통합당’으로 합의했다고 14일 밝혔다","2016년 5월 16일 중앙선거관리위원회에 등록한 뒤 현재까지 존속 중이다"],"reason":"The merger, the agreed name, the 14 November announcement and the earlier use of the name by 더불어민주당 are accurate. It omits the main point about recycled party names and the professor's comment. The 통합민주당 sentence is stated without context, so it is unclear how it relates."},"B":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["‘민주통합당’이란 당명은 현재 여당인 더불어민주당이 지난 2011년 12월부터 2013년 5월까지 사용했던 이름이다","2016년 ‘민주통합당’과 ‘국민의당’이란 이름이 21대 총선을 앞두고 부활했다"],"reason":"The sentence about the name is garbled. It says the name 더불어민주당 used was revived by 더불어민주당 itself ahead of the 21st general election, which misstates who revived it. It also treats 통합민주당 as if it were revived. The quote from the professor is accurate."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["통합을 추진 중인 바른미래당과 대안신당, 민주평화당은 오는 17일까지 합당 작업을 완료","김형준 명지대 정치학과 교수는"],"reason":"It accurately covers the merger, the name, the earlier use of the name and the professor's view. It omits the recycled-name theme, the 국민의당 revival and the point that the name 통합민주당 already exists."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":2,"evidence":["‘민주통합당’이란 당명은 현재 여당인 더불어민주당이 지난 2011년 12월부터 2013년 5월까지 사용했던 이름이다","민주당(2008~2011년)"],"reason":"It says 더불어민주당 and 민주평화당 used the name from 2011 to 2013. The source says only 더불어민주당 used it, so this is a wrong entity relation. The subject of the clause is also missing. The professor's comment and the merger facts are otherwise accurate."}}}
